<!-- -- How it works -- -->
<section id="how" class="how-section">
  <div class="section-wrap">
    <div class="text-center mb-14">
      <div class="section-eyebrow" style="background:rgba(16,185,129,0.08);color:#6ee7b7;border:1px solid rgba(52,211,153,0.18)">
        <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/></svg>
        Simple workflow
      </div>
      <h2 class="section-title">From setup to results</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">A straightforward process that keeps organizers, judges, tabulators, and audiences in perfect sync.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-5 relative">
      <!-- Connector line (desktop only) -->
      <div class="hidden md:block absolute top-[52px] left-[calc(12.5%+28px)] right-[calc(12.5%+28px)] h-px" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,rgba(99,102,241,0.3),transparent)"></div>

      <div class="step-card sr sr-delay-1">
        <div class="step-number" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1e3a8a,#2563eb)">1</div>
        <h3 class="font-extrabold text-sm mb-3" style="color:#e2e8f0">Create an Event</h3>
        <p class="text-sm" style="color:#64748b;line-height:1.65">Admin sets up the event, adds contestants, and defines scoring criteria with weights and categories.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="step-card sr sr-delay-2">
        <div class="step-number" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4c1d95,#7c3aed)">2</div>
        <h3 class="font-extrabold text-sm mb-3" style="color:#e2e8f0">Judges Score</h3>
        <p class="text-sm" style="color:#64748b;line-height:1.65">Judges log in independently and enter scores per contestant per criterion — from any device, in real time.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="step-card sr sr-delay-3">
        <div class="step-number" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#065f46,#10b981)">3</div>
        <h3 class="font-extrabold text-sm mb-3" style="color:#e2e8f0">Tabulator Reviews</h3>
        <p class="text-sm" style="color:#64748b;line-height:1.65">Tabulator verifies all submitted scores, checks for errors, and ensures everything is accurate before the final reveal.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="step-card sr sr-delay-4">
        <div class="step-number" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#78350f,#d97706)">4</div>
        <h3 class="font-extrabold text-sm mb-3" style="color:#e2e8f0">Results Revealed</h3>
        <p class="text-sm" style="color:#64748b;line-height:1.65">ScoreSync computes weighted averages, breaks ties, and reveals rankings with a cinematic announcement screen.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- -- FAQ -- -->
<section class="faq-section">
  <div class="section-wrap">
    <div class="text-center mb-12 sr">
      <div class="section-eyebrow" style="background:rgba(99,102,241,0.08);color:#a78bfa;border:1px solid rgba(99,102,241,0.2)">
        <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg>
        Common Questions
      </div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Frequently asked</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Everything you need to know before getting started.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">

      <div class="faq-item sr sr-delay-1">
        <button class="faq-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          Who can use ScoreSync?
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-body">
          <p>Anyone running a competition — pageant organizers, school event committees, cultural festivals, talent show hosts. ScoreSync supports multiple roles: Admin, Organizer, Judge, and Tabulator, each with their own access level.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item sr sr-delay-2">
        <button class="faq-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          How many judges can score at the same time?
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-body">
          <p>There is no hard limit. All judges score independently and in real time — scores are aggregated automatically as each judge submits. The system handles multiple judges simultaneously without conflict.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item sr sr-delay-3">
        <button class="faq-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          Can I customize the scoring criteria?
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-body">
          <p>Yes. Each event has its own set of criteria with custom names, weights (percentages), and max scores. You can define as many criteria as your competition requires — beauty, talent, Q&A, and more.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item sr sr-delay-5">
        <button class="faq-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          Is the data secure?
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-body">
          <p>ScoreSync is built on Firebase with encrypted data transmission, role-based access control, and CSRF protection. Only authorized users with the correct role can view or submit scores.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

